  "section_notes": "The final rules are a compromise: S1 is strict on incident reporting; S2 adopts a 55°C/5% testing regime but does not automatically ban models exceeding 5%, instead requiring corrective action and allowing sales; S3 and S4 accept Halcyon's red lines (6-year retrofit, 36-month suppression) while S5 sets an 8/100k recall trigger with flexible remedies."
